OL,3,GNEWSAEight charged after collapse costs
OL,4,Ainvestors #251m
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight individuals have been charged by
OL,7,Fthe Serious Fraud Office (SFO)
OL,8,Ffollowing its investigation into the
OL,9,Fcollapse of a Kent-based company whose
OL,10,Finvestors lost an estimated #251m.
OL,12,FLondon Capital & Finance Plc (LCF)
OL,13,Fcollapsed in 2019 at significant
OL,14,Ffinancial cost to its 11,200 investors,
OL,15,Fthe SFO said.
OL,17,FThe eight individuals charged in
OL,18,Fconnection with the investigation will
OL,19,Fappear at Westminster Magistrates'
OL,20,FCourt on 7 December.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
