OL,3,GNEWSAEight charged after collapse costs
OL,4,Ainvestors #251m
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma Isaac, head of division for the
OL,7,FSFO, said the charges "mark a
OL,8,Fsignificant step forward in our
OL,9,Finvestigation into the collapse of the
OL,10,Ffirm and ensuring those responsible are
OL,11,Fheld to account".
